hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"128","Ḥasbunallāhu wa ni`mal-wakīl. Allah is sufficient for us and the best of those on whom to depend. Reference: Al-Bukhari, 5/172."
"129","Allahumma Rabbas-samawatis-sab'i, wa Rabil-'Arshil-'azim, kun li jaaran min fulan ibn fulan, wa ahzabihi min khalaiqik, an yafruta 'alayya ahadun minhum aw yatgha, 'azza jaaruka, wa jalla thanaa'uka, wa la ilaha illa anta.. O Allah, Lord of the seven heavens and Lord of the Great Throne, be my protector against so-and-so, son of so-and-so, and his followers among Your creation, lest any of them oppress or transgress against me. Your protection is mighty, Your praise is glorious, and there is no god but You."
